
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. HELLO-WORLD.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 OPEN-BALANCE PIC S9(5) VALUE ZERO.
    01 DEPOSIT-BALANCE PIC S9(5) VALUE ZERO.
    01 UPDATED-BALANCE PIC Z(6) VALUE ZERO.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Enter open balance:"
    ACCEPT OPEN-BALANCE
    DISPLAY "Enter deposit balance:"
    ACCEPT DEPOSIT-BALANCE
    IF OPEN-BALANCE > 0 AND DEPOSIT-BALANCE > 0
        COMPUTE UPDATED-BALANCE =
            OPEN-BALANCE + DEPOSIT-BALANCE
        DISPLAY "Updated Balance:" FUNCTION TRIM(UPDATED-BALANCE)
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "Invalid Input"
    END-IF

    STOP RUN.
